abstract: >-
  Reference implementation of corrected bypass semantics, linear filter
  sections, and oversampled nonlinear magnetic modeling for inductor-based
  equalizer research. Companion code to the paper "High-Pass and Low-Pass
  Modeling Failures in Inductor EQ Emulations".
keywords:
  - audio signal processing
  - equalizer
  - inductor
  - hysteresis
  - Jiles-Atherton
  - oversampling
  - wave digital filter
  - research scaffold
